    "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v2.1.2.0 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Fixes\r\n* fix(deprecation): bundleOf in DeviceIdDialogFragment by @researchxxl in https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/pull/290\r\n* bug(onboarding): fix state consistency in onboarding activity by @dbhavsar76 in https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/pull/293\r\n### Features\r\n* Upgrade onboarding experience to material design by @dbhavsar76 in https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/pull/200\r\n* refactor(web gui): refactor the webgui activity to kotlin and material design by @dbhavsar76 in https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/pull/296\r\n* feature: support custom https certificate by @dbhavsar76 in https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/pull/300\r\n\r\nOther\r\n* chore(dependencies): updated\r\n* chore(syncthing): v2.1.2\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/researchxxl/syncthing-android/compare/v2.1.1.0...v2.1.2.0",
